# The look path's painter's order (QA7 V7-015): swaying trees are drawn in their turn with
# everything else, so a tree standing in front of a house covers its wall. At the Kydathenaion
# fountain in Athens an olive stands before a house: its crown, not the wall, is under the
# region (the wall reads near (209, 182, 135); the crown is grey-green). The terraced quarter's
# pines in front of higher terraces are the second shot.
set chatter quiet
set weather clear
set time 0.2
set season spring
set day 1
set world 272 611 2
wait 40
expect color 590,330,60,40 159 167 127 25
shot shots/look_order_fountain_2x.png
set world 231 575 1
wait 40
shot shots/look_order_terraces_1x.png
quit
